sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cu as Customer
  participant S as LockerService
  participant A as LockerAssigner
  participant RP as ReturnPackage
  participant R as LockerRepository
  participant Lg as Logistics
  participant E as LockerEvents
  Cu->>S: requestReturn(customer, order, item, location)  (R11)
  S->>A: assign(location, item.dims, returnId)
  A-->>S: Locker (BOOKED)
  S->>RP: new ReturnPackage(customerCode)
  S->>E: emit ReturnRequested → email customer code
  Cu->>S: dropReturn(location, customerCode)
  S->>RP: drop(code, now)  %% customer code destroyed, logistics code issued
  S->>R: occupy(lockerId)
  S->>E: emit ReturnDropped
  Lg->>S: collectReturn(location, logisticsCode)  (R12)
  S->>RP: collect(code, now)
  S->>R: release(lockerId)
  S->>E: emit ReturnCollected → refund per product eligibility
